PN,34601
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F346A1785424694
OL,3,CTrust questioned over if it has
OL,4,Cresources to improve after Nottingham
OL,5,Cattacks
OL,7,FThe NHS trust that provides mental
OL,8,Fhealth services across Nottinghamshire
OL,9,Fhas been questioned as to whether it
OL,10,Fhas the resources and money to make
OL,11,Fimprovements following the Nottingham
OL,12,Fattacks.
OL,14,FValdo Calocane, who was diagnosed with
OL,15,Fparanoid schizophrenia in 2020, was
OL,16,Fdischarged from the care of
OL,17,FNottinghamshire Healthcare NHS
OL,18,FFoundation Trust a matter of months
OL,19,Fbefore he killed three people in June
OL,20,F2023.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/11
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,347,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F346A1785424694
OL,3,CTrust questioned over if it has
OL,4,Cresources to improve after Nottingham
OL,5,Cattacks
OL,7,FCalocane, now 34, killed Barnaby
OL,8,FWebber, Grace O'Malley-Kumar and Ian
OL,9,FCoates on June 13, before attempting
OL,10,Fto run down survivors Wayne Birkett,
OL,11,FSharon Miller and Marcin Gawronski
OL,12,Fwith Mr Coates' van.
OL,14,FThe trust faced scrutiny at a public
OL,15,Finquiry earlier this year.
OL,17,FNorthumbria Police, acting on behalf
OL,18,Fof Nottinghamshire Police, has since
OL,19,Finformed the trust that it is under
OL,20,Fcriminal investigation for potential
OL,21,Fcorporate manslaughter.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/11
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,347,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F346A1785424694
OL,3,CTrust questioned over if it has
OL,4,Cresources to improve after Nottingham
OL,5,Cattacks
OL,7,FThe trust has now refreshed its
OL,8,Fstrategy as a result of its failings,
OL,9,Fand this was discussed at a Nottingham
OL,10,FCity Council health meeting on 23 July.
OL,12,FIts refreshed strategy says it will
OL,13,Faim to put patients first with joined-
OL,14,Fup care, while staff will be made to
OL,15,Ffeel safe and supported with
OL,16,Fcompassionate leadership.
OL,18,FCraig Sharples, chief of staff at the
OL,19,Ftrust, told councillors the strategy
OL,20,F"was about listening" to both
OL,21,Fcolleagues and patients.
OL,26,@|D@AOU|D@UO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/11
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,347,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F346A1785424694
OL,3,CTrust questioned over if it has
OL,4,Cresources to improve after Nottingham
OL,5,Cattacks
OL,7,FBasford councillor Nick Raine (Lab and
OL,8,FCo-op) questioned how the culture
OL,9,Fwould be changed to create a listening
OL,10,Fenvironment, and if the trust had the
OL,11,Fresources to put in place improvements.
OL,13,F"We've had a national tragedy which
OL,14,Fhas had national attention in terms of
OL,15,Fa mentally unwell individual who then
OL,16,Fmurdered three people, which is awful
OL,17,Ffor our city and an appalling
OL,18,Ftragedy," he said.
OL,26,@uD@AOUzD@IO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G4/11
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,347,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F346A1785424694
OL,3,CTrust questioned over if it has
OL,4,Cresources to improve after Nottingham
OL,5,Cattacks
OL,7,F"Do you actually have the resources
OL,8,Fand money to actually deliver this
OL,9,Fstrategy effectively?"
OL,11,FMr Sharples said: "I echo what you
OL,12,Fsaid around the tragedy.
OL,14,F"This is about how we learn from what
OL,15,Fhappened in the past and how we move
OL,16,Fforward to ensure the safety and
OL,17,Fquality of our services our residents
OL,18,Freceive are of the highest order.
OL,26,@oD@AOUqD@VO]sD@SOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G5/11
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,347,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F346A1785424694
OL,3,CTrust questioned over if it has
OL,4,Cresources to improve after Nottingham
OL,5,Cattacks
OL,7,F"In terms of our culture the inquiry
OL,8,Fremains ongoing, but the Care Quality
OL,9,FCommission (CQC) has been very clear
OL,10,Fwith us in terms of what our staff
OL,11,Fhave said and how our staff feel.
OL,26,@oD@AOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G6/11
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,347,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F346A1785424694
OL,3,CTrust questioned over if it has
OL,4,Cresources to improve after Nottingham
OL,5,Cattacks
OL,7,F"We are listening to that and that has
OL,8,Finformed this strategy. But the old
OL,9,Fadage, 'culture eats strategy for
OL,10,Fbreakfast', there is an awful lot of
OL,11,Fwork we need to do across our
OL,12,Forganisation to listen and hear what
OL,13,Four staff say, how they feel, how we
OL,14,Fcreate an environment where they are
OL,15,Fable to provide their best quality
OL,16,Fcare. That is a fundamental tenet of
OL,17,Fthis strategy.
OL,26,@oD@AOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G7/11
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,347,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34608
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F346A1785424694
OL,3,CTrust questioned over if it has
OL,4,Cresources to improve after Nottingham
OL,5,Cattacks
OL,7,F"Have we got enough money and
OL,8,Fresources? Has anybody at the moment
OL,9,Fin terms of where we are at in the
OL,10,Fpublic sector?
OL,12,F"One of the core drivers around this
OL,13,Fstrategy is around sustainability, and
OL,14,Fhow we provide the most effective and
OL,15,Fproductive systems and processes that
OL,16,Ftranslate into the best quality of
OL,17,Fcare with the money available to us.
OL,19,F"Would we like some more money? Of
OL,20,Fcourse. But we are very clear we have
OL,21,Fgot to work within our means."
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@AOU{D@AOU}D@^O]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G8/11
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,347,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34609
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F346A1785424694
OL,3,CTrust questioned over if it has
OL,4,Cresources to improve after Nottingham
OL,5,Cattacks
OL,7,FTo refresh its strategy, the trust
OL,8,Fsays it has spoken to 60 patients,
OL,9,Fcarers and family members, as well as
OL,10,Fmore than 1,000 of its colleagues and
OL,11,F18 external partners.
OL,13,FHowever, Cllr Saj Ahmad (Lab), who has
OL,14,Fworked for the NHS for nearly a decade
OL,15,Fand represents Wollaton West, said:
OL,16,F"To me that is a very small number of
OL,17,Fpatients to speak to in relation to
OL,18,Fsomething that is ultimately about
OL,19,Fpatients."
OL,26,@xD@AOU{D@JO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G9/11
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,347,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34610
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F346A1785424694
OL,3,CTrust questioned over if it has
OL,4,Cresources to improve after Nottingham
OL,5,Cattacks
OL,7,FPaula Vaughan, deputy director of
OL,8,Fplanning and partnerships at the
OL,9,Ftrust, added: "In terms of the number
OL,10,Fyou are right, it is not high. I think
OL,11,Fyou might have missed in my
OL,12,Fpresentation which talks about the
OL,13,Fspeed in which we have done the
OL,14,Frefresh; it was over a course of weeks
OL,15,Fnot months, it was a refresh not a
OL,16,Frewrite.
OL,18,F"You are right about the number of 60,
OL,19,FI brought it up at the time that it
OL,20,Fwasn't as high as we'd like."
OL,26,@qD@OOUzD@AOU|D@]O]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4         G10/11
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,347,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34611
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F346A1785424694
OL,3,CTrust questioned over if it has
OL,4,Cresources to improve after Nottingham
OL,5,Cattacks
OL,7,FHowever, she said the conversations
OL,8,Fwith the individuals had been "very
OL,9,Frich, helpful, and very honest".
OL,11,FThe trust said its future work would
OL,12,Fbe about making the culture safer, in
OL,13,Fa bid to create an environment that
OL,14,Fallows more people to be heard and
OL,15,Fcome forward with their concerns.
OL,26,@pD@_OUqD@_O]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4         G11/11
